# Swordsman, Sharp Scoundrel: whenever an equipped creature you control attacks, it connives (CR 701.50). Stolen Stark Tech is on
# the Swordsman (3/2), which attacks on turn 3: it draws Lightning Bolt and discards it, a nonland card, so gets a +1/+1 counter and
# deals 4 to Bot2. Connive draws the turn's draw step as well, so the Bolt was the second card.

